# Print server (local)

Copy to `printing/.env` — never commit secrets.

```env
GATEWAY_JWT_SECRET=<same hex as root .env>
GATEWAY_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173
PRINT_HOST=0.0.0.0
PRINT_PORT=3132
```

If `3132` is stuck on Windows, use `3133` and either:

- `VITE_PRINT_SERVER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3133`, or
- Vite `POSR_PRINT_PORT=3133` with empty `VITE_PRINT_SERVER_URL` (same-origin `/print` proxy)

See [SESSION-2026-08-26-ASI-PRINTERS.md](../docs/integrations/SESSION-2026-08-26-ASI-PRINTERS.md).
